ource policy</span></label><div class="admin-form-actions"><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Save AI configuration</button></div></form><div class="inline-actions ai-test-actions"><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('/admin/ai/provider/test'))?>"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="btn outline" type="submit">Test connection</button></form><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('/admin/ai/provider/models'))?>"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="btn outline" type="submit">Refresh models</button></form></div><?php if($modelOptions):?><div class="model-results"><strong>Available models (<?=count($modelOptions)?>)</strong><p class="muted">The refreshed model list is now available in the Text model field above.</p><div class="ai-model-grid"><?php foreach(array_slice($modelOptions,0,120) as $m):?><code><?=e($m)?></code><?php endforeach;?></div></div><?php endif;?></section>
